        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8054,  2-3/8” x 7-1/8” Quincy Door Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 7-1/8 Inch Quincy Sideplate is an elegant statement piece that will be sure to add traditional glamor to your doors. This sideplate is available in a huge selection of finish colors with your choice of trim knob or lever. With so many options to choose from, you'll be sure to find the perfect match. The Quincy 7-1/8 Inch Non-keyed Sideplate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the 7-1/8 Inch Quincy Door Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim and sideplate.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Quincy 7-1/8 Inch Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 7-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8054-specifications.pdf?v=1704262427\"><b>Emtek 8054 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs / levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior sideplate. Turning inside knob / lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8980-finish.jpg?v=1704354744\" width=\"524\" height=\"102\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8980 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
